    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This lightweight and compact software is designed for internal company meetings where screen sharing is needed over a local network. It is easy to use: simply specify the port, set a room password, and click start. This will launch a local screen sharing service and provide a URL link that other participants can use to view the shared screen via a web browser.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently, the software only supports screen sharing and does not include audio sharing. It is an ideal solution for companies with internal network-based meetings, particularly those facing connectivity issues between internal and external networks.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This lightweight and compact software is designed for internal company meetings where screen sharing is needed over a local network. It is easy to use: simply specify the port, set a room password, and click start. This will launch a local screen sharing service and provide a URL link that other participants can use to view the shared screen via a web browser.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently, the software only supports screen sharing and does not include audio sharing. It is an ideal solution for companies with internal network-based meetings, particularly those facing connectivity issues between internal and external networks.</p>",
    "short_description": "This lightweight software enables screen sharing for internal company meetings over a local network. Simply set a port, password, and start the service. Participants can view the screen via a browser link. Audio sharing is not supported yet.",
